# Scene1-3-2

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐3-2
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor

; 学校のチャイム音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_57 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:（奇怪……这是什么地方来着……）|#0103Adv02_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛独自走在走廊上。<br>这是一条似曾相识的学校走廊。|#0103Adv02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:意识到这一点的瞬间，<br>希望涌上了心头，<br>她的表情顿时明朗起来。|#0103Adv02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（魔女也好，审判也好，还有那些凶杀案，<br>　全都只是一场噩梦！）|#0103Adv02_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我根本没有被囚禁，<br>　而是在学校里！）|#0103Adv02_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（对了，得快点，<br>　不然要迟到了——）|#0103Adv02_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 廊下を走る音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_58 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

; 少女たちのくすくす笑う声
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:刚要跑起来，<br>突然传来的嘲笑声让艾玛的身体瞬间僵住了。|#0103Adv02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊……）|#0103Adv02_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嘲笑声从教室里传来。|#0103Adv02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不能看教室。<br>　不能再做旁观者了）|#0103Adv02_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不能看里面的人！<br>　不能听那个声音！）|#0103Adv02_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（必须移开视线，<br>　必须捂住耳朵）|#0103Adv02_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（否则我的心，会崩溃——）|#0103Adv02_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管内心在拼命示警，<br>艾玛却仿佛被某种力量操控着，<br>还是往里面看去。|#0103Adv02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：BGM切る・黒画面・UIも消す・ささやきのみ
; ========================================

@StopBgm
@HidePrinter
@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Simple MakeDefault:true HideOther:true
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

; 立ち絵・話者名の表示なし
; 月代ユキ

[PrintTextModified Text:——啊啊，艾玛。我一直在等你哦。|#0103Adv02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——这里的每个人都好丑陋啊。|#0103Adv02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——光是活着就让人觉得肮脏呢。|#0103Adv02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——不如大家都去死好了。|#0103Adv02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说着，她故意夸张地咧开嘴角，<br>露出一个扭曲的笑容。|#0103Adv02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的脸庞，还有她的双眸，都被绝望浸染。|#0103Adv02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:#ffffff Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Default MakeDefault:true HideOther:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0103Adv02_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呼，呼，呼，呼……|#0103Adv02_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛猛地坐起身，急促地喘息着。<br>全身冒着冷汗，心脏剧烈跳动。|#0103Adv02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是梦吗……？|#0103Adv02_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_17_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛梦中的情景很快就变得模糊，<br>消散在遗忘的彼方。|#0103Adv02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:确认自己身在监牢的牢房内后，<br>她反而松了一口气。|#0103Adv02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而就在平复呼吸的过程中，<br>她察觉到一阵强烈的寒意。|#0103Adv02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（怎么回事……好难受……<br>　全身都在疼……）|#0103Adv02_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:连坐着都很吃力，<br>艾玛只好重新躺回床上。|#0103Adv02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（是不是生病了……？）|#0103Adv02_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她用床边的手机确认时间。<br>现在已经到早晨了。|#0103Adv02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（对了，今天要去野餐……）|#0103Adv02_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛早上好～！<br>今天天气也很好呢！|#0103Adv02_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:去吃早餐吧……<br>咦，艾玛？|#0103Adv02_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:艾、艾玛小姐，看起来好像不太舒服……！|#0103Adv02_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉、汉娜、梅露露三人走进牢房，<br>立刻注意到艾玛的异常。<br>|#0103Adv02_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露连忙跑到床边，<br>将手贴在艾玛的额头上。|#0103Adv02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（凉凉的好舒服……）|#0103Adv02_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:发烧了……！糟、糟糕了……！<br>得赶快去医务室……！|#0103Adv02_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……没什么大不了的。<br>睡一觉应该就好了……|#0103Adv02_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是对不起，野餐可能要延期了……|#0103Adv02_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:别在意这种事啦～！|#0103Adv02_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:就是就是！等艾玛好起来再举办吧！<br>现在请好好休息！|#0103Adv02_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我去准备一些东西……<br>药品啊，水啊，毛巾什么的……|#0103Adv02_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（明明好不容易策划好的……真的对不起大家……）|#0103Adv02_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怀着对三人的歉意，<br>艾玛的意识渐渐陷入了朦胧。|#0103Adv02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

